# MLSP 2013 Bird Classification — swarm final solution

Multi-label bird-species presence from 10 s / 16 kHz audio; metric **ROC-AUC** (global over all
`(rec_id, species)` rows). Submission format: `Id = rec_id*100 + species`, columns `Id,Probability`.

## Final model (blend)
`submission.csv` = `sigmoid( 0.5 * mean_logit(core_6) + 0.5 * logit(multilabel_MLP) )`

`core_6` is an **equal-weight logit average** of six fold-safe models:
| key | model | owner | OOF global AUC |
|---|---|---|---|
| `lr_multiastneigh` | LR on 3×AST embeddings (mean/max/std) + AudioSet logits + hist/segment-mil + metadata + fold-safe session/date/acoustic neighbours | pollux_epsilon | 0.9301 |
| `lr_clapastneigh` | LR on CLAP + AST + hist/mil + metadata + fold-safe neighbours | pollux_epsilon | 0.9221 |
| `et_emb64log` | ExtraTrees on hist/seg/meta + AST-PCA64 + AudioSet + fold-safe neighbours | altair_gamma | 0.9214 |
| `lgb_emb64log` | LightGBM on same features | altair_gamma | 0.9199 |
| `et_meta` | ExtraTrees on hist/seg/meta + fold-safe session/date neighbour-label features | altair_gamma | 0.9039 |
| `et_astneigh` | ExtraTrees on AST + hist/mil + metadata + neighbours | pollux_epsilon | 0.9134 |
| `mlp_rich_mixup` | multi-label MLP (BCE + mixup, 5-fold × 5 seeds) on 3×AST + CLAP + AudioSet + hist/mil + metadata + raw-audio PCA + neighbours | pollux_beta | 0.9359 |

**Blend OOF (5-fold, pooled): `<metric>0.9418<metric>`; per-fold 0.923 / 0.931 / 0.948 / 0.964 / 0.945.**
